From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mmis1000 <mmis10002@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:37:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Shared terminal views: per-window views, shared grid,
 targeted replays

- Pty host tracks the windows viewing each lifetime-managed terminal (attach,
  detach, heartbeat with attached ids, gone windows); viewCount in lifetime info
- Shared grid: views report setViewState; the pty is sized to the minimum over
  visible views and OverrideDimensions goes to every view when shared
- Replays go only to the attaching window and stay dimension-exact: the view
  switches from the recorded size straight to the shared grid afterwards, and
  grid changes during a replay are deferred
- Terminal query replies only accepted from the most recently focused view
- Close confirmation for terminals shown in several windows
- Terminal: Show Remote Terminals quick pick (shares Attach to Session code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
